  a skos:Concept;
  skos:definition "At Verizon, our top priority is to safeguard our information assets and reputation. The Verizon Integrated Security Framework (ViSF), pronounced “vee-sif”,  is a comprehensive cybersecurity framework of policies, requirements and standards. ViSF will align with NIST CSF 2.0, internal requirements and industry best practices"@en;
